      "text": "API Gateway checks the token and throttles before the planner runs.\nTraveller service slow or down: 2 s deadline + circuit breaker, then 503 with Retry-After.\nUnknown boarding or walk time uses a labelled estimate; stale catalogue drops offers; no fit gives a clear no-result.",
